yer":"original","quote":"十二年春正月，魏诛大将军曹爽等，右将军夏侯霸来降。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-1ad31c5c5fda82d8db29","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9affbe81d5e4a7563a4e","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，出毓为廷尉，司隶毕轨又枉奏免官〖2〗。众论多讼之〖3〗，乃以毓为光禄勋","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":583,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-e3414b7540851f912fcf","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-90bffa095285fdb22467","layer":"original","quote":"时比能已还漠南〖14〗，招与刺史毕轨议曰〖15〗：“胡虏迁徙无常。若劳师远追，则迟速不相及；若欲潜袭，则山溪艰险，资粮转运，难以密办。可使守新兴、雁门二牙门〖16〗，出屯陉北；外以镇抚，内令兵田〖17〗；储蓄资粮，秋冬马肥；州郡兵合，乘衅征讨：计必全克","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":254,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-55fe0d03372d16080ee1","layer":"original","quote":"保塞鲜卑大人步度根，与叛鲜卑大人轲比能私通〖9〗。并州刺史毕轨表〖10〗：“辄出军以外威比能〖11〗，内镇步度根。”帝省表曰〖12〗：“步度根以为比能所诱〖13〗，有自疑心。今轨出军，适使二部惊合为一；何所威镇乎？促敕轨：已出军者，慎勿越塞过句注也〖14〗！”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o032b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-55fe0d03372d16080ee1","layer":"original","quote":"保塞鲜卑大人步度根，与叛鲜卑大人轲比能私通〖9〗。并州刺史毕轨表〖10〗：“辄出军以外威比能〖11〗，内镇步度根。”帝省表曰〖12〗：“步度根以为比能所诱〖13〗，有自疑心。今轨出军，适使二部惊合为一；何所威镇乎？促敕轨：已出军者，慎勿越塞过句注也〖14〗！”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-p026a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f434b51d181f1b72fce0","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《世语》曰：“并州刺史毕轨，送汉故度辽将军范明友鲜卑奴，年三百五十岁，言语饮食，如常人。奴云：‘霍显，光后小妻。明友妻，光前妻女。’”","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-159cbc19673a18061659","start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o032","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-55fe0d03372d16080ee1","layer":"original","quote":"保塞鲜卑大人步度根，与叛鲜卑大人轲比能私通〖9〗。并州刺史毕轨表〖10〗：“辄出军以外威比能〖11〗，内镇步度根。”帝省表曰〖12〗：“步度根以为比能所诱〖13〗，有自疑心。今轨出军，适使二部惊合为一；何所威镇乎？促敕轨：已出军者，慎勿越塞过句注也〖14〗！”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o033","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-p026","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f434b51d181f1b72fce0","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《世语》曰：“并州刺史毕轨，送汉故度辽将军范明友鲜卑奴，年三百五十岁，言语饮食，如常人。奴云：‘霍显，光后小妻。明友妻，光前妻女。’”","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-159cbc19673a18061659","start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o043b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o043","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-91594aaa37c7f634c45a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-217f7a92077c8b2f0cd5","layer":"original","quote":"曹爽诛","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":480,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0006","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿〖3〗。舅甥并典兵，专淮南之重。凌就迁为司空〖4〗。司马宣王既诛曹爽，进凌为太尉，假节、钺。凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0164","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"司马宣王既诛曹爽","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0364b595e9ceeba2c64c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"比能遣子将骑与尚等会战于楼烦〖27〗，临阵害尚、弼","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4b216514364195ceb362","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"并州刺史毕轨遣将军苏尚、董弼等击之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-604235d65ce57b8377c3","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-6c30f7f2ead157650caf","layer":"original","quote":"毕轨有陉北之败","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-cfb1d29c968d96de0767","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"帝遣骁骑将军秦朗征之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8e4ad1798ee19f92c5ab","layer":"original","quote":"南阳何晏、邓飏、李胜，沛国丁谧，东平毕轨，咸有声名，进趋于时〖8〗；明帝以其浮华，皆抑黜之〖9〗。及爽秉政，乃复进叙〖10〗，任为腹心。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o062a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f39d7dc77da58c377bcf","layer":"original","quote":"初，爽以宣王年德并高，恒父事之〖1〗，不敢专行。及晏等进用，咸共推戴，说爽以“权重，不宜委之于人”。乃以晏、飏、谧为尚书，晏典选举；轨司隶校尉，胜河南尹：诸事希复由宣王。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o063a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-d8762b253b4c7b8f234e","layer":"original","quote":"宣王遂称疾，避爽。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o071b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-650ce0d2c114d6dfb6ac","layer":"original","quote":"于是收晏等下狱，会公卿朝臣，廷议〖2〗，以为：“《春秋》之义，‘君亲无将，将而必诛’〖3〗。爽以支属〖4〗，世蒙殊宠，亲受先帝握手遗诏，托以天下；而包藏祸心，蔑弃顾命〖5〗，乃与晏、飏及当等谋图神器；范党同罪人：皆为大逆不道〖6〗。”于是收爽、羲、训、晏、飏、谧、轨、胜、范、当等，皆伏诛，夷三族。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p029a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f578c0e697f4d0061345","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞初，宣王以爽魏之肺腑，每推先之；爽以宣王名重，亦引身卑下：当时称焉。丁谧、毕轨等既进用，数言于爽曰：“宣王有大志而甚得民心，不可以推诚委之。”由是爽恒猜防焉。礼貌虽存；而诸所兴造，皆不复由宣王。宣王力不能争，且惧其祸，故避之。","attribution":"裴注叙事（未署引书）","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":310,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a087b300aa2c10ab2b24","start":0,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p039a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-065bd82d6c2f0df7badf","layer":"pei","quote":"毕轨，字昭先。父字子礼，建安中为典农校尉。轨以才能，少有名声。明帝在东宫时，轨在文学中。黄初末，出为长（史）〔吏〕。明帝即位，入为黄门郎；子尚公主，居处殷富。迁并州刺史。其在并州，名为骄豪。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":1,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p039b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-065bd82d6c2f0df7badf","layer":"pei","quote":"时杂虏数为暴，害吏民；轨辄出军，击鲜卑轲比能，失利。中护军蒋济表曰：‘毕轨前失，既往不咎；但恐是后，难可以再。凡人材有长短，不可强成。轨文雅志意，自为美器。今失并州，换置他州；若入居显职，不毁其德，于国事实善。此安危之要，唯圣恩察之。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":96,"end":213,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p039c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-065bd82d6c2f0df7badf","layer":"pei","quote":"至正始中，入为中护军。转侍中、尚书，迁司隶校尉。素与曹爽善，每言于爽，多见从之。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":214,"end":254,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0050-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-065bd82d6c2f0df7badf","layer":"pei","quote":"毕轨，字昭先","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":1,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o060","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8e4ad1798ee19f92c5ab","layer":"original","quote":"南阳何晏、邓飏、李胜，沛国丁谧，东平毕轨，咸有声名，进趋于时〖8〗；明帝以其浮华，皆抑黜之〖9〗。及爽秉政，乃复进叙〖10〗，任为腹心。飏等欲令爽立威名于天下，劝使伐蜀；爽从其言，宣王止之不能禁。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o062","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f39d7dc77da58c377bcf","layer":"original","quote":"初，爽以宣王年德并高，恒父事之〖1〗，不敢专行。及晏等进用，咸共推戴，说爽以“权重，不宜委之于人”。乃以晏、飏、谧为尚书，晏典选举；轨司隶校尉，胜河南尹：诸事希复由宣王。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o071","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-650ce0d2c114d6dfb6ac","layer":"original","quote":"初，张当私以所择才人张、何等，与爽。疑其有奸，收当治罪。当陈：“爽与晏等阴谋反逆〖1〗，并先习兵，须三月中欲发。”于是收晏等下狱，会公卿朝臣，廷议〖2〗，以为：“《春秋》之义，‘君亲无将，将而必诛’〖3〗。爽以支属〖4〗，世蒙殊宠，亲受先帝握手遗诏，托以天下；而包藏祸心，蔑弃顾命〖5〗，乃与晏、飏及当等谋图神器；范党同罪人：皆为大逆不道〖6〗。”于是收爽、羲、训、晏、飏、谧、轨、胜、范、当等，皆伏诛，夷三族。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":209,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o108-review","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e8aa83f31b75ca2487ba","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：夏侯、曹氏，世为婚姻。故惇、渊、仁、洪、休、尚、真等，并以亲旧肺腑〖1〗，贵重于时；左右勋业〖2〗，咸有效劳〖3〗。爽德薄位尊，沉溺盈溢〖4〗；此固大《易》所著〖5〗，道家所忌也〖6〗。玄以规格局度〖7〗，世称其名；然与曹爽中外缱绻〖8〗，荣位如斯；曾未闻匡弼其非，援致良才。举兹以论，焉能免之乎〖9〗？","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":643,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p029","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f578c0e697f4d0061345","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞初，宣王以爽魏之肺腑，每推先之；爽以宣王名重，亦引身卑下：当时称焉。丁谧、毕轨等既进用，数言于爽曰：“宣王有大志而甚得民心，不可以推诚委之。”由是爽恒猜防焉。礼貌虽存；而诸所兴造，皆不复由宣王。宣王力不能争，且惧其祸，故避之。","attribution":"裴注叙事（未署引书）","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":310,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a087b300aa2c10ab2b24","start":0,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p039","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-065bd82d6c2f0df7badf","layer":"pei","quote":"“毕轨，字昭先。父字子礼，建安中为典农校尉。轨以才能，少有名声。明帝在东宫时，轨在文学中。黄初末，出为长（史）〔吏〕。明帝即位，入为黄门郎；子尚公主，居处殷富。迁并州刺史。其在并州，名为骄豪。时杂虏数为暴，害吏民；轨辄出军，击鲜卑轲比能，失利。中护军蒋济表曰：‘毕轨前失，既往不咎；但恐是后，难可以再。凡人材有长短，不可强成。轨文雅志意，自为美器。今失并州，换置他州；若入居显职，不毁其德，于国事实善。此安危之要，唯圣恩察之。’至正始中，入为中护军。转侍中、尚书，迁司隶校尉。素与曹爽善，每言于爽，多见从之。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":0,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-f8ee2d84b0b05cdd35ab","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-e37fd50f0de3d8d787fa","layer":"original","quote":"冗从仆射毕轨表言〖9〗：“尚书仆射王思精勤旧吏〖10〗，忠亮计略不如辛毗，毗宜代思。”帝以访放、资。放、资对曰：“陛下用思者，诚欲取其效力，不贵虚名也。毗实亮直，然性刚而专，圣虑所当深察也。”遂不用。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
